<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>06 / 学校端</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>数据诚信三原则</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 18 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={1140} height={300} viewBox='0 0 1140 300'><rect x='0' y='0' width='1140' height='92' rx='8' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='570.0' y='40.0' font-size='22' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>原则一 · 显示覆盖范围</text><text x='570.0' y='66.0' font-size='15' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>质量报告须显示数据覆盖范围、评价版本与未知部分</text><path d='M562 93 l8 8 l-8 8' fill='none' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='0' y='104' width='1140' height='92' rx='8' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='570.0' y='144.0' font-size='22' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>原则二 · 不因数据少判低</text><text x='570.0' y='170.0' font-size='15' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>接入不完整的班级不能只因数据少被判为质量低</text><path d='M562 197 l8 8 l-8 8' fill='none' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='0' y='208' width='1140' height='92' rx='8' fill='#9FD0F5'/><text x='570.0' y='248.0' font-size='22' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>原则三 · 跨口径不可比</text><text x='570.0' y='274.0' font-size='15' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>不同试卷、评分规则、帮助条件的结果未经校准不能直接比较</text></svg></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：学校端设计思路.md §2</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 60 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>